// `geom` — a fixture package for the harness, not a real library.
//
// It exists so `//@ dep:` fixtures have something to bind that is (a) built from
// this repo, so the tests stay hermetic, and (b) shaped like a real package: a
// top-level module plus a *directory* of modules, which is the thing the
// directory-namespace fixtures are actually about.
//
// A `//@ dep:` package is built with `--lib --package-name geom` and *no*
// prelude (see `dep_meta` in harness.rs), so nothing here may use std — plain
// structs and procs over primitives only.

import vec2
import shapes/rect
import shapes/circle
